omavirus: the HART study</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2003</year><volume>362</volume><fpage>1871</fpage><lpage>1876</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||362|1871||bib4|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14667741</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>de Brux</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Orth</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Croissant</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Cochard</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Ionesco</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Condylomatous lesions of the uterine cervix: their course in 2466 patients</article-title><source>Bull Cancer</source><year>1983</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>410</fpage><lpage>422</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Bull Cancer||70|410||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6686786</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Department of Health</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Department of Health Bulletin 2001&#x0002f;22, Cervical Screening Programme</source><year>2001</year>England, 2000&#x02013;2001, September 2001</citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esteve</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Benhamou</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>Descriptive Epidemiology</source><year>1994</year><publisher-name>Lyon, France: International Agency for Cancer Research</publisher-name>IARC Scientific Publications No. 128. IV</citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hildesheim</surname><given-names>A